      "instance_name": "yoda_character",
      "label": "Yoda Character",
      "description": "Yoda is a fictional character from the Star Wars franchise, known for his wisdom and philosophical sayings. His iconic appearance and often sarcastic or ironic delivery are used in memes to convey humor or commentary. The meme relies on the audience recognizing Yoda as a wise figure to create irony when paired with the phrase 'the stupid is strong in this one.'",
