      "instance_name": "mocking_irony",
      "label": "mocking and ironic emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is a sarcastic or ironic mockery, conveyed through Yoda's exaggeratedly wise facial expression juxtaposed with the absurd and derogatory phrase 'the stupid is strong in this one.' The visual of Yoda, typically associated with profound wisdom, is used to ironically highlight the perceived foolishness of the subject, creating a tone of ridicule.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
