      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "Yoda is mapped as 'the stupid'",
      "description": "The text 'the stupid' is overlaid on Yoda's face, creating an analogical mapping where Yoda is being represented as 'the stupid'. This is a direct textual projection onto the visual entity, using Yoda's iconic appearance to embody the derogatory label.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
